    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-07-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Python is a good language for</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Data Science</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Python suits data science, but it is also one of the best options for beginners.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Beginners</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Python suits beginners, but most data scientists also use it as their main tool.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Both</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Python is simple enough for beginners, and most data scientists use it as their main tool.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
