    "        <p>Not quite. Libraries are one reason, but Python is also simple to learn.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>it is a rich yet simple language</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Simplicity is one reason, but Python also has a lot of libraries.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
