    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Python is simple, and it has a lot of libraries for solving practical problems.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
